# the EXACT quantitative x100 gate of the "boost" arm, re-run through
# every routing knob of the RZ production conduction stack that could
# plausibly assemble or consume the ion chi_perp differently --
# an explicit conduction_theta (== theta: conduction_stage must stay
# false and the staged arithmetic must not run), step-old frozen
# coefficients (the boost input follows conduction_coefficient_state),
# the free-streaming flux limiter, armed DEFINED-convention
# per-component clamps PLUS the legacy shared pair (the per-component
# precedence must not re-route the boost), and the hlld fan. The
# measured ion chi must still be raw x100 and the electron channel must
# still be frozen. conduction_qs_chi is absent BY LAW: the parse guard
# rejects it alongside the dp boost -- the additive quasi-shorting term
# saturating every face onto the perp cap was exactly the production
# masking mechanism this arm regression-proofs the rest of the stack
# against.
#
# The ripple amplitude is lowered to keep the armed limiter INERT at
# the boosted flux (|q|/(f q_fs) ~ 6e-2 at t = 0, a ~5% depression of
# the measured chi, well inside the x100 gate): this arm gates the
